<title>UK: London gold fixes just easier, activity light.</title>
<headline>London gold fixes just easier, activity light.</headline>
<text>
<p>GOLD - Fixed at $348.00 vs $349.10 previously. Fairly quiet, some Australian selling seen in Far East. Little activity in Europe. Seen edging lower.</p>
<p>SILVER - Barely changed and in middle of recent range.</p>
<p>$4.78/$4.80. May retest support at $4.72.</p>
<p>PLATINUM - Touch firmer at $365.50/$366.50.</p>
<p>PALLADIUM - Firmer after fresh 21-month high fix.</p>
</text>
